Task 3 – Cloud-Based Bus Pass System

Objective

Develop a cloud-ready online bus ticket booking and pass management system.

Features

- Passenger registration
- Ticket booking
- Seat allocation
- Booking confirmation
- Cloud scalability support

Example Ticket Structure

ticket = {
    "passenger": "Sani Ibrahim Maijikkah",
    "route": "Gusau - Kaura Namoda",
    "seat": 12,
    "status": "Confirmed"
}

print(ticket)

Cloud Deployment Idea

This system can be hosted using:

- AWS EC2
- AWS S3
- AWS RDS
- AWS Elastic Beanstalk

Result

The project provides a simple prototype of a scalable cloud-based transportation booking system.
